{"sections":[{"slug":"滤范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"滤范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"滤范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">滤范畴是满足如下等价条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中所有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有限范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">图都有锥</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">以</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为指标范畴的余极限与所有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有限范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">极限交换</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">依惯例</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">语境下</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">改用</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}